{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123132","id":4429814067,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCAmZMw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123132","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123132.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123132.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123132","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123132/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123132/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123132/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d0108466bc8571d90f4eca9055003e1a39d83749","number":123132,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Strip trailing path separators in `OS::get_safe_dir_name`","user":{"login":"misakaikato","id":12230661,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjMwNjYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12230661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato","html_url":"https://github.com/misakaikato","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nWhen `application/config/custom_user_dir_name` ends with a slash, `OS::get_safe_dir_name()` keeps it, so every path built from `user://` carries a double slash. `ProjectSettings.globalize_path(\"user://\")` returns `…/MyGame//`, and at startup the renderer cannot create its shader cache folder.\n\n- Fixes #110029\n- Fixes #106062\n\n## Additional information\n\nTrailing separators are now trimmed in `get_safe_dir_name()` next to the existing trailing-period trim. Both callers that pass `p_allow_paths` are covered (`OS::get_user_data_dir()` and the project manager's user dir lookup). In the default mode separators are already replaced with `-`, so nothing changes there.\n\nBefore/after with `custom_user_dir_name = \"MyGame/\"` on macOS, current master:\n\n| | before | after |\n|---|---|---|\n| `OS.get_user_data_dir()` | `…/MyGame/` | `…/MyGame` |\n| `ProjectSettings.globalize_path(\"user://\")` | `…/MyGame//` | `…/MyGame/` |\n| `Can't create shader cache folder` at startup | printed | gone |\n| `FileAccess.open(\"user://shader_cache/x\", WRITE)` | fails | works |\n\nNested names such as `Studio/Game/` behave the same. A leading slash is harmless because `path_join()` already handles it.\n\nNot covered: a name ending in `\" /\"` now yields a trailing space. That is a pre-existing limitation of the period trim as well (`\"name .\"` → `\"name \"`), and changing it would relocate existing user directories on Linux, so it is left for a separate discussion.\n\nAI disclosure: this PR was prepared with Claude Code's assistance under my direction; I reviewed every line and verified the before/after behavior locally.\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-03T06:16:32Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T11:46:41Z","closed_at":"2026-09-03T07:49:51Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6765d3c44c67269b30311688d6dc67b67b9fd07d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"misakaikato:fix-custom-user-dir-trailing-slash","ref":"fix-custom-user-dir-trailing-slash","repo":{"id":1355486592,"node_id":"R_kgDOUMsVgA","name":"godot","full_name":"misakaikato/godot","owner":{"login":"misakaikato","id":12230661,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjMwNjYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12230661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato","html_url":"https://github.com/misakaikato","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misakaikato/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":null,"visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":0,"open_issues":0,"size":1594777,"default_branch":"master","has_issues":false,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_downloads":false,"has_discussions":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pushed_at":"2026-09-03T06:16:30Z","created_at":"2026-09-03T03:54:30Z","updated_at